   "kind": "doc",
   "title": "Checkout conversion drop — Oct 14",
   "version": 1,
   "content": "# Checkout conversion drop — Oct 14\n\n## Summary\nCheckout conversion fell from **62.7% to 56.6%** on Oct 14 (−6.1 points). Nearly all of it is iOS Safari, where completion dropped from 61.8% to 41.2%.\n\n## Cause\nRelease 2026.10.14 moved the wallet button above the card form on mobile. On iOS Safari 17 the wallet sheet then failed to open (INC-884, 14:10–19:40 UTC). Android, desktop and iOS Chrome moved less than one point.\n\n## Evidence\n- Funnel by platform and browser from data.csv (see funnel.py).\n- Release notes and incident INC-884 on the status page.\n- The Checker confirmed 3 of 3 claims; the drop starts at 14:12 UTC.\n\n## What we do not know\nWhether the 20% off campaign sent at 13:00 UTC changed who reached checkout. It raised traffic; it did not lower completion.\n\n## Next step\nKeep the wallet button rollback in place, add a Safari wallet check to the release smoke test, and re-run this workstream tomorrow to confirm recovery.\n"
  }
 },
